Vaiyiw
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 9 DEAL FREAMA
FREAMA 10 FACE_ALL
FREAMA 5 FACE_ALL
FREAMA 2 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE FREAMA FREAMA
AND
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS, CLUBS, SPADES}
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        DEST Size < 9
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL FREAMA Empty
        PILE ALL FREAMA Empty
